This package bundles BusyBox, which is licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 2.

BusyBox is Copyright (C) its many contributors. It is included here unmodified,
as built and distributed by the Magisk project.

Complete corresponding source code for this BusyBox build is available from:

  https://github.com/topjohnwu/ndk-busybox

and the upstream project at:

  https://busybox.net/

306gapps itself is not derived from BusyBox and is distributed separately;
BusyBox is merely included alongside it so the installer has a predictable set
of tools in recovery.
